  "faqBookQ": "How do I book a service?",
  "faqBookA": "Find the service on Home or Services and tap Book Now. Choose how you want it (at the shop, at your place or pickup & drop), pick a day and a free time, and confirm. The shop then confirms your request and we let you know.",
  "faqNoTimesQ": "Why can't I see any times on a day?",
  "faqNoTimesA": "The shop may be closed that day or fully booked, or today's times may have passed. The message under the dates says which; try another day.",
  "faqCancelQ": "How do I cancel a booking?",
  "faqCancelA": "Open Bookings and tap Cancel booking on it. You can cancel until the provider is on the way.",
  "faqRescheduleQ": "Can I change the time of a booking?",
  "faqRescheduleA": "Yes. Open the booking and tap Change time. You can do it twice per booking, up to 2 hours before it starts, until a professional has been assigned. After that, message the shop from the booking's chat.",
  "faqPayQ": "When and how do I pay?",
  "faqPayA": "Nothing is paid when you book. Once the shop confirms, tap Pay on the booking to pay online by UPI, card or net banking (through Razorpay), or choose to pay in cash when the job is done.",
  "faqRefundQ": "How do refunds work?",
  "faqRefundA": "When an online payment is refunded, the money goes back the way you paid; your bank may take a few working days to show it. The booking then shows Refunded. For a problem with a paid booking, report it and Alakh support will look into it.",
  "faqPickupQ": "How does pickup & drop work?",
  "faqPickupA": "Choose Pickup & drop when booking, pick the address and tell us what to collect. The item is collected, serviced at the shop and brought back. Bookings shows each step and when it is expected back.",
  "faqHomeQ": "How do home visits work?",
  "faqHomeA": "Choose At my place when booking and pick a saved address. A professional comes at the time you chose, and once they are on the way you can follow them live from Bookings. Any home visit fee is shown before you confirm.",
  "faqReviewQ": "How do I rate or review a shop?",
  "faqReviewA": "After a booking is completed, tap Rate on it in Bookings. Reviews show your first name and last initial and are marked Verified booking.",
  "faqProblemQ": "Something went wrong with my booking. What do I do?",
  "faqProblemA": "Tap Report a problem on the booking, or use \"Report a problem with a booking\" below. Alakh support looks into every report and gets back to you.",
  "faqProfileQ": "How do I change my name or addresses?",
  "faqProfileA": "In Profile, use Edit Profile for your name and Saved addresses for the places we come to. Your sign-in number can't be changed in the app; contact Alakh support for that.",
  "faqSessionsQ": "How do I sign out, or sign out of other devices?",
  "faqSessionsA": "Tap Log out in Profile to sign out on this phone. To sign out of all your other devices (a lost phone, say), choose a new password with Forgot Password on the sign-in screen: every other device is signed out. Alakh support can also help.",
  "faqDeleteQ": "How do I delete my account?",
  "faqDeleteA": "In Profile, tap Delete my account. Your profile, saved addresses and sign-in are removed; past bookings and payments are kept without your name for the shops' records.",
